			},
			"date": "2024-02-23T20:17:29.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I’m not sure what company you’re sub-tooting, so I can’t comment on the specific example you have in mind. Perhaps you are right.😅</p><p>We have many products for JetBrains, so while Devrel may be aware of some surface-level stuff, it's not easy to know every implementation detail that may prevent a quick resolution.</p>",
