			"date": "2024-02-23T22:25:09.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Legal reasons. Everything wrong DevRel utter through whatever channel can get in the way and cost the company a sh1tload of money.</p>",
