			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@mia\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>mia</span></a></span> oh yeah, I’m guessing this is the primary reason why Apple (apropos of nothing) had little to no devrel presence for many years.</p>",
