			},
			"date": "2024-02-24T16:23:10.687Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://toot.cafe/@tomayac\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>tomayac</span></a></span> yeah, I guess. For super large companies, wouldn’t it be best case for devrel to get legal training to avoid such a case? It all seems like part of the job (imo)</p>",
